                                                "sense_id": "0759757e-adfb-34b9-abb9-cbad47fd8820",
                                                "text": "Martin walked around the vehicle, viewing it from all angles and giggling as he did so. “She's a ripper, Bert, a real ripper!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a92b11c-5e81-437b-b90b-d65b7f5863c7",
                                                "sense_id": "0759757e-adfb-34b9-abb9-cbad47fd8820",
                                                "text": "Really, the Strauss Ball was in a category of its own, which is why we are making such a fuss about it; an absolute ripper of a ball whatever the hell it should be called in technical terms."
